Course Section: CSCI 3321
Project Name: Oracle of Shrimp
Team Members: Cameron Allison, Sweeny Eate, Deborah Lee, Ross Palacio, and Logan Sedwick
Project Summary: It will tell your dreams, hopes, and desires. It's very simple! Click on the shrimp to get your very real and true fortune. Your {insert your shrimp’s name here} will perform nautical ritual to give you your fortune once clicked.
Examples of Project Features:
Feature 1: Shrimp will give a user a fortune.
Feature 2: The shrimp will be animated when clicked on.
Feature 3: User can name or rename their shrimp.
Feature 4: Fortunes will be stored in a database and queried when a user needs a fortune.
Feature 5: User can toggle to get evil fortune.
Feature 6: Shrimps will be collectible
